          "text": "Primary: NSTEMI\n\nSecondary: Severe three-vessel coronary artery disease, not for PCI — MDT decision for medical management\n\nBackground:\n- Heart failure with reduced ejection fraction (EF 35%)\n- Chronic kidney disease stage 3b\n- Type 2 diabetes mellitus\n- Hypertension\n- Previous MI 2019",
